,"用一个完整表单看清标签与提交"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"名称描述与状态分别回答一个问题"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"FormData 收集的是可提交的字段"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"先把原生校验用对再定制错误提示"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"焦点表示键盘接下来会操作哪里"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"用原生 dialog 完成一次进出弹窗"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"动态提示要出现也要适度"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"数据表格先交代行列之间的关系"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"框架最终仍要生成可用的 HTML"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"用一条完整操作路径检查理解"],["BUTTON",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","type":"button","class":"level-3"},"参考与延伸阅读"],""]],["ARTICLE",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","class":"material-sheet","data-material-path":"/knowledge/materials/web-01-html-semantics-forms-accessibility.md/web-01","data-reader-ready":"true"},["DIV",{"data-v-765dde2a":"","class":"chapter-intro"},["SPAN",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"这一篇，读懂一个问题"],["H2",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"页面怎样让鼠标、键盘与辅助技术理解同一件事？"],["UL",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"",["LI",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"选用符合操作含义的原生元素"],["LI",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"解释标签、字段名、提交数据与错误关联"],["LI",{"data-v-765dde2a":""},"让弹窗的草稿、取消和焦点形成完整流程"],""]],["DIV",{"data-v-949f2829":"","data-v-765dde2a":"","class":"markdown-renderer reader-content"},["ARTICLE",{"data-v-949f2829":"","class":"markdown-body","aria-label":"Markdown 内容","data-pronunciations":"ready"},["H2",{"id":"web-01-html-语义表单与可访问性基础"},"WEB-01 HTML 语义、表单与可访问性基础"],"\n",["P",{},"一个“保存”控件看起来像按钮，按 Tab 却到不了；一个输入框边上写着“邮箱”，读屏软件却只念“编辑”；错误已经显示，用户仍不知道该改哪一项。它们通常不是再补一点颜色就能解决的问题，而是页面没有把内容、操作和状态表达清楚。"],"\n",["P",{},"HTML 给浏览器的不只是盒子。选用正确元素、建立正确关联，能让鼠标、键盘和辅助技术使用同一套页面。本篇用资料检索、账户表单和阅读设置弹窗，逐步建立这套结构。例子以桌面浏览器为主。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"学习前先确认"},"学习前先确认"],"\n",["P",{},"本讲不要求其他站内前置。只需认识开始标签、结束标签和属性；后文会就地解释名称、描述、焦点和 ARIA。"],"\n",["P",{},"标注为完整页面的 HTML 示例可分别保存成 ",["CODE",{},".html"]," 文件，直接用浏览器打开；页面之间不共享变量或元素。结构片段会明确说明放置位置。示例只在当前页面展示结果，不向服务器提交个人信息。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"先让页面结构能被说清楚"},"先让页面结构能被说清楚"],"\n",["P",{},"想象去掉全部颜色、边框和图标，你还应当能说清“这是哪一页，主要内容是什么，有哪些小节”。下面是放在页面 ",["CODE",{},"body"]," 中的一段资料详情结构："],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"code-block","data-language":"html"},["DIV",{"class":"code-block__bar"},["SPAN",{},"html"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"code-copy"},"复制代码"]],["PRE",{"class":"hljs"},["CODE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"header"],">"],"\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"href"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"/\""],">"],"知识资料库",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"],">"],"\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"nav"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"aria-label"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"主导航\""],">"],"\n    ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"href"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"/knowledge\""],">"],"知识点",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"],">"],"\n    ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"href"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"/plan\""],">"],"学习计划",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"a"],">"],"\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"nav"],">"],"\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"header"],">"],"\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"main"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"id"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"main-content\""],">"],"\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"h1"],">"],"HTML 语义与表单",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"</",["SPAN",{"class"